# Scattered into Shadow (jeuno 61), Tebhi's timers and another char's TEBHI_RESPAWN listener in one zone tick (the P10
# final review's M8). Two chars at Prog 4 in Castle Oztroja (Tebhi made NORMAL by the first listener tick). Main trades
# the collar (Prog 5, respawnTime the wall clock + 180, the timers at 2000 and 4000 ms), and the wall clock moves a day
# on before any tick. One tick of 4001 ms then holds both timers and bob's listener: as in CZoneEntities::ZoneServer,
# Tebhi (an NPC) ticks before the chars, so tebhiFade ('kesu') and tebhiGone (CUTSCENE_ONLY) run first and bob's
# listener, after them, finds Tebhi hidden and his respawnTime passed: NORMAL, 'deru', all in that one step. The next
# tick: NORMAL, nothing.
lists CastleOztroja/Tebhi/onTrade
char zone=CastleOztroja pos=-134.5,24,-21 job=BST lvl=50
char bob zone=CastleOztroja pos=-134.5,24,-19 job=BST lvl=50
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold completed
quest Jeuno.ScatteredIntoShadow accepted
charvar Quest[3][61]Prog 4
charvar Quest[3][61]Stage 7
item BeastCollar
bob: quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold completed
bob: quest Jeuno.ScatteredIntoShadow accepted
bob: charvar Quest[3][61]Prog 4
bob: charvar Quest[3][61]Stage 7
login                                       # main's listener
bob: login                                  # bob's listener
tick 400                                    # Tebhi NORMAL, 'deru'
trigger Tebhi                               # walk to him
trade Tebhi BeastCollar x1                  # main: Prog 5, TEBHI_ACCEPTS; the two timers
wait jst=1                                  # the wall clock a day on, before any tick
tick 4001                                   # tebhiFade, tebhiGone, then bob's listener: NORMAL, 'deru' (one step)
tick 400                                    # NORMAL: nothing
